{
  "background_and_question": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Sotomayor",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "86820512e1805b01b9a7a35b370b5a611b0ba10f75aa61f9e52feedf714d6289",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-86820512e180-0000-0005"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 4,
              "start": 4
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Sotomayor, what is the authority for a bankruptcy court to adjudicate proof of claims without violating Article\u202fIII?"
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Scalia",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "86820512e1805b01b9a7a35b370b5a611b0ba10f75aa61f9e52feedf714d6289",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-86820512e180-0001-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 20,
              "start": 20
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Scalia, can the Federal Government require a party to pursue a claim in a non\u2011Article\u202fIII tribunal?"
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Ginsburg",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "86820512e1805b01b9a7a35b370b5a611b0ba10f75aa61f9e52feedf714d6289",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-86820512e180-0001-0004"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 23,
              "start": 23
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Ginsburg, will the bankruptcy court\u2019s handling of a tort claim be futile under 11\u202fU.S.C.\u202f\u00a7\u202f157(b)(5)?"
      }
    ],
