              "start": 3
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Kent L. Richland, petitioner alleges he was damaged because the respondent falsely accused him of cheating her out of money that the late husband intended to give her."
      }
    ],
    "heading": "Overview",
    "status": "complete",
    "summary": null,
